{"title":"Career Roadmap · Textile Designer","role":"Textile Designer","summary":"A Textile Designer develops the visual, structural and functional characteristics of fabrics and textile surfaces. The role combines textile science, colour, pattern development, fabric construction, surface design, CAD, digital printing and commercial fashion/product requirements.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Textile Engineering / Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Build textile, colour, drawing and design fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Learn fabric construction, surface design and textile CAD"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Develop commercial design portfolio + industry internship"}],[{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Enter as Junior Textile Designer / Design Trainee"}],[{"text":"2030–2034"},{"text":"Develop independent collections and client-facing skills"}],[{"text":"2034–2038"},{"text":"Senior Textile Designer / Specialist"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Design Lead / Design Manager / Product Development"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Creative Director, Design Consultant or independent studio"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Textile + visual foundation"},{"text":"Textile fibres, colour theory, drawing, design principles"},{"text":"Design exercises"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Textile design capability"},{"text":"Weaving, knitting, printing, dyeing, surface design"},{"text":"Fabric/design samples"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Digital + commercial design"},{"text":"CAD, Photoshop/Illustrator, trend research, collection development"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Professional specialisation"},{"text":"Advanced CAD, product development, sustainability, merchandising"},{"text":"Final collection + industry project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop both textile knowledge and visual-design ability."},{"type":"h","text":"Textile fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural fibres"},{"text":"Synthetic fibres"},{"text":"Regenerated fibres"},{"text":"Yarn types"},{"text":"Fabric structures"},{"text":"Weaving"},{"text":"Knitting"},{"text":"Nonwovens"},{"text":"Textile finishing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fibre","Yarn","Fabric","Finishing","End Product"]},{"type":"h","text":"Design fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing"},{"text":"Sketching"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Shape"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Pattern"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Repetition"},{"text":"Visual balance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical exercises"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colour boards"},{"text":"Texture boards"},{"text":"Pattern studies"},{"text":"Motif development"},{"text":"Repeat-pattern exercises"},{"text":"Fabric swatches"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Textile Design Specialisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Surface design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Screen printing"},{"text":"Digital printing"},{"text":"Block printing"},{"text":"Resist printing"},{"text":"Embroidery"},{"text":"Appliqué"},{"text":"Jacquard"},{"text":"Dyeing"},{"text":"Surface embellishment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fabric design"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plain weave"},{"text":"Twill"},{"text":"Satin"},{"text":"Jacquard"},{"text":"Dobby"},{"text":"Knitted structures"},{"text":"Rib"},{"text":"Interlock"},{"text":"Advanced fabric constructions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Colour"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colour matching"},{"text":"Colour harmonies"},{"text":"Colour forecasting"},{"text":"Dye behaviour"},{"text":"Colour fastness"},{"text":"Pantone-based colour communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio work"},{"type":"p","text":"Start building a physical + digital textile portfolio."},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Inspiration","Moodboard","Research","Motif","Colour Palette","Repeat","Fabric Application","Final Product"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Become Industry-Ready"},{"type":"p","text":"This year should focus on digital design and commercial applications."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Photoshop"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Textile CAD software"},{"text":"CLO 3D or equivalent 3D fashion/textile workflow"},{"text":"Procreate or equivalent digital illustration tool"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the target employer, also explore textile-specific CAD systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital textile design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seamless repeats"},{"text":"Half-drop repeats"},{"text":"Mirror repeats"},{"text":"Placement prints"},{"text":"Engineered prints"},{"text":"Colourways"},{"text":"Digital textile rendering"},{"text":"Print-ready artwork"},{"text":"Technical specifications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Trend research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fashion trends"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Colour trends"},{"text":"Material trends"},{"text":"Competitor collections"},{"text":"Regional textile traditions"},{"text":"Luxury vs mass-market design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Commercial Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary direction."},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisat