orts textiles"},{"text":"Filtration textiles"},{"text":"Composite materials"},{"text":"High-performance fibres"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a pathway from conventional textile design toward engineering-driven textile product development."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Textile Design"},{"text":"Fashion Design"},{"text":"Textile Technology"},{"text":"Sustainable Fashion"},{"text":"Textile Engineering"},{"text":"Material Design"},{"text":"Technical Textiles"},{"text":"Fashion Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential destinations"},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Strong Areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Textile design, fashion, surface design"}],[{"text":"Italy"},{"text":"Luxury textiles, fashion and product design"}],[{"text":"France"},{"text":"Fashion, luxury and textile design"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Sustainable design and material innovation"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Textile technology and technical textiles"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Textile technology, design and material innovation"}],[{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"Textile craft, technology and material innovation"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Textile/fashion design and sustainability"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio is often particularly important for design-focused postgraduate applications."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Textile Designer / Design Trainee"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pattern development"},{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Colourways"},{"text":"Trend research"},{"text":"Production coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Textile Designer / Product Developer"},{"type":"p","text":"Take ownership of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Client requirements"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Seasonal designs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Textile Designer / Design Lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design collections"},{"text":"Junior designers"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Brand requirements"},{"text":"Commercial design decisions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Manager / Creative Lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design strategy"},{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Brand identity"},{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Client relationships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"12+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Creative Director","Design Director","Textile Consultant","Independent Design Studio"]}]},{"heading":"Technical Specialist Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students who prefer textile technology over fashion:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Textile Designer","Textile Technologist","Senior Textile Technologist","Technical Textile Specialist","R&D/Innovation Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smart textiles"},{"text":"Functional fabrics"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Technical textiles"},{"text":"Performance testing"},{"text":"Material innovation"}]}]},{"heading":"Creative Leadership Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Junior Designer","Textile Designer","Senior Designer","Design Lead","Design Manager","Creative Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"Trend forecasting"},{"text":"Brand strategy"},{"text":"Consumer research"},{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Commercial awareness"}]}]},{"heading":"Entrepreneurship Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Textile Technology graduate can eventuall